        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brownton%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Brownton was officially incorporated as a city in 1886, solidifying its municipal status.",
